@startuml
title The states of a variance calibration

[*] --> proposed : a fit of a stored input
[*] --> rejected : a fit that could not be made\n(too few returns, no admissible shape)
[*] --> approved : an authored shape\ninstalled with the feeds

proposed --> approved : a reviewer approves,\nwith a reason
proposed --> rejected : a reviewer rejects,\nwith a reason
approved --> superseded : a later calibration\nof the pair is approved

rejected --> [*]
superseded --> [*]

note right of approved
  At most one approved calibration
  of a pair is current.
  The pair's GJR-GARCH feeds run it.
end note
@enduml
